  "oracle_text": "When The First Doctor enters, search your library and/or graveyard for a card named TARDIS, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle.\nWhenever you cast a spell with cascade, put a +1/+1 counter on target artifact or creature."
